24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Synonima. 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Hispanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Curae de passionibus oculorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   getilgter Eintrag (Besitzvermerk?). 88\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Inhalts\u252 \'fcberblick zum Folgetext. 89\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Constantinus Africanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pantegni Practica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Notizen \u252 \'fcber Geld.   }

