1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Haggai; 103\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Sacharja; 124\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Maleachi). 129\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 130\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Petrus Lombardus, Sententiae in XII prophetas (unvollendet). 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat.}

