\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Biblischer Vorspann (einst verklebt). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   ebenso. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   R\u246 \'f6merbrief. 49\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Korintherbrief (I). 84\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Korintherbrief (II). 95\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Galaterbrief. 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Epheserbrief. 123\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Philipperbrief. 131\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Kolosserbrief. 138\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Thessalonikerbrief (I). 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Thessalonikerbrief (II). 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Timotheusbrief (I). 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Timotheusbrief (II). 160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Titusbrief. 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Philemonbrief. 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Hebr\u228 \'e4erbrief. 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat (Leimspuren).}

