\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat (Federproben). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Notiz (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  aeterna processio spiritus sancti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 3\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vacant. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  Ivo Carnotensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Panormia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Prolog; 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch I; 26\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch II; 42\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch III; 63\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch IV; 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch V; 86\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch VI; 98\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch VII; 108\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 119\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch VIII [unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig]). 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Einzeldekrete. 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Proverbia. 121\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. Siehe auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hauke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

