\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des Buches: Johannes Heynlin, Resolutorium dubiorum circa celebrationem missarum. Beigebunden: Bernardinus Vitali, Manuale divinum ex sacrarum litterarum. \endash  Confessio valde utilis tam sacerdotis quam penitenti edita. \endash  Antoninus Florentinus, Confessionale. \endash \plain \f2\lang1033\fs16  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Pietro Giorgio Tolomei,\plain \f3\fs16  \plain \f4\fs24 Translatio miraculosa ecclesie beate Marie virginis de Loreto.}

