1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5500[51]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hesekiel}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   tr\u228 \'e4umt vom Evangelium (\u252 \'fcber ihm stehen die vier {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5500[52]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Evangelistensymbole}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), in E(\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  t factum est in tricesimo anno\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (Ez). 301\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   sitzender {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5500[30]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Daniel mit L\u246 \'f6wen}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in A(\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  nno tercio regni Ioachim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (Dn). 309\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   sitzender {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5500[31]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prophet Hosea}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in U(\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  erbum domini quod factum est ad Osee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (Os). 312\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   lehrender {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5500[32]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Joel mit Buch}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in U(\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  erbum domini quod factum est ad Ioel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (Ioel). 313\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   sitzender {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5500[33]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prophet Amos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , in U(\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  erba Amos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (Am). 315\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5500[34]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Prophet Abdias}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (= Obadjah), in U(\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  isio Abdie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (Ob). 316\p