\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Ia\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vacat. Ia\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Griechisches und hebr\u228 \'e4isches Alphabet; Merkverse zum Liber extra (14. Jh.). Ib\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. Ic\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Glossen zum Liber extra, Buch V,1. II\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 221\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gregor IX.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber extra mit Glossa ordinaria des Bernardus Bottonius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Bl. 55\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 56\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 105\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 106\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 159\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 160\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant). 222\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant. 223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\endash 224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Lectura arboris consanguinitatis et affinitatis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Zeichnungen (s. u.). 225\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 226\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vacant. Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Wunderle.}

