\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   sehr viel sp\u228 \'e4ter nachgetragener Titel (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Biblia Sacro Sancta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 407\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Biblia sacra, Altes Testament}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 407\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 510\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Biblia sacra, Neues Testament}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 511\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 543\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Nomina hebraica}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Schreibervers}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pro me scriptore rogo vos fratres venerari illum qui genuit tandem me morte redemit. Post hec implorat Herman et iugiter orat ut simus digni postremum vita beari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [siehe auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Remak-Honnef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]. 543\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 544\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.  }

