\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Hermann \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Diels\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Die Handschriften der antiken \u196 \'c4rzte (Abhandlung der K\u246 \'f6niglich Preu\u223 \'dfischen Akademie der Wissenschaften 1905/1906). Teil I, Berlin 1905, S. 6, 9, 15, 102, 105, 107. Teil II, Berlin 1906, S. 84, 103. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Stauber\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 228. \endash  Lynn \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Thorndike\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , A history of magic and experimental science. 1. During the first thirteen centuries of our era. London 1923, S. 750. \endash  Pearl \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Hippocrates latinus. Repertorium of hippocratic writings in the latin middle ages. In: Traditio 31, 1975, S. 106. \endash \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Pearl \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Hippocrates latinus. Repertorium of hippocratic writings in the late middle ages, 2. In: Traditio 32, 1976, S. 280. \endash  Pearl \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Hippocrates latinus. Repertorium of hippocratic writings in the late middle ages, 7. In: Traditio 37, 1981, S. 273. \endash  Richard J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Durling\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Corrigenda and addenda to Diels\rquote  Galenica. Bd. 2: Codices miscellanei. In: Traditio 37, 1981, S. 373, 381. \endash  Mario \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Grignaschi, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Il catalogo delle opere di Ippocrate e Galeno nel \u8222 \'84Del vita et moribus philosophorum\ldblquote . In: Medioevo 16, 1990, S. 361. \endash  Mario\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Grignaschi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8222 \'84Corrigenda et addenda\rdblquote  sulla questione dello Ps. Burleo. In: Ebenda, S. 338, 341. \endash  Mario \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Grignaschi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Il catalogo delle opere di Ippocrate e Galeno nel \u8222 \'84De vita et moribus philosophorum\rdblquote . In: Medioevo 16, 1990, S. 361. \endash  Cornelius \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 O\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \rquote \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Boyle\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Thirteenth- and fourteenth-century copies of the \u8222 \'84ars medicine\ldblquote . A checklist and contents descriptions of the manuscripts (Articella studies 1). Cambridge 1998, S. 114f. \endash  Rolf \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Bergmann, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Katalog der althochdeutschen und alts\u228 \'e4chsischen Glossenhandschriften, Bd. 6. Berlin 2005, Nr. 440, IV, S. 2836.}

