3\fs24  \endash 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Thomas de Aquino, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[10].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Summa de articolis fidei et sacramentis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 135\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tituli zu Bonaventura, De quatuor libris sententiarum. 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 143\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[11].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 144\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 219\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Thomas de Aquino, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[12].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De potentia}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 220\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[13].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Sermones}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (mit Nachtr\u228 \'e4gen [223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]). 223\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Auflistung der behandelten Themen. 224\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat (und Besitzeintrag, s. o.).  }

