\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1a\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Besitz- und Kaufvermerk, 14. Jh. (s. o.). 1b\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tabula f\u252 \'fcr Teil 3 (alphabetisch). 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tituli f\u252 \'fcr Buch XVII. 4\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XVII. 38\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tituli f\u252 \'fcr Buch XVIII. 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XVIII. 74\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tituli f\u252 \'fcr Buch XIX. 75\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XIX. 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tituli f\u252 \'fcr Buch XX. 111\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XX. 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 156\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tituli f\u252 \'fcr Buch XXI. 157\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXI. 187\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 188\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs