\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Schenkungsvermerk (s. o.). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Tractatus de interdicto (nachgetragen). 6\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Schenkungsvermerk (s. o.). 7\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 459\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Decretum Gratiani}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   mit Glossen (des Bartholomaeus Brixiensis; 383\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat). 459\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 460\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Innocentius II., Papa, Epistulae et Privilegia 106 (?). 460\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  vacat.}

