\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Iustinianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Digestum vetus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   mit Glossen (u. a. des Accursius). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Bruchst\u252 \'fcck eines \u228 \'e4lteren Anfangs von Buch I. 2\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch I. 11\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch II. 27\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch III. 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch IV. 59\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 72\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch V. 73\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch VI. 78\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch VII. 90\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch VIII. 100\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch IX. 110\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch X. 120\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XI. 127\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XII. 139\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 147\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XIII. 148\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XIV. 155\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 162\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XV. 163\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XVI. 170\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XVII. 182\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XVIII. 193\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XIX. 206\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XX. 214\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXI. 227\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXII. 234\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXIII. 246\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 252\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Buch XXIV. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat18 Kolophon}}\plain