\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Inhalt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. I\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Giorgio Maffei, Brief an Andrea Badoer; Brief an Francesco Barbaro (etc.). 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Francesco Petrarca}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De otio religioso}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Bl. 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Kolophon}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Finitus est presens divus liber favente Deo sub anno domini nostri Ihesu Christi currente ab eius nativitate millesimo trecentesimo nonagesimo quinto die veneris decimo septimo mensis septembris tercia indicione regnante Johanne Galeaz Dei gracia Mediolani inclito duce et comitte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  virtutum etc. in Verona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; endet mit Rasur [Schreibernamen?]). 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Ps.-Plutarchus, Brief an Trajan; Giorgio Maffei, Brief an Nicol\u242 \'f2 Loschi. 35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Francesco Petrarca,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1  Brief an Andrea Dandalo (unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig). \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  35\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Petrus Paulus Vergerius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vita Petrarcae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 36\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacat. 37\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 39\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Hannard von Gameren}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Reliquiae sanctorum contra haereticos defensae}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ingolstadt 1565). 40\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\endash v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vacant.}

