30/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Doctrina Galieni de interioribus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 61\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Rasis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Liber experimentorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . 64\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 r\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash 65\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 v\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Idem, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Antidotarium}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (unvollendet). Siehe \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rauner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . }

